    <p>\xC9diteur : ${m(z.author)}, <a href="mailto:${m(z.contact)}">${m(z.contact)}</a>. H\xE9bergement : GitHub Pages, GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, \xC9tats-Unis.</p>
